    "《船长别回来》不收集、不上传任何个人信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captain, Don't Come Back collects and uploads no personal information."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 游戏进度只保存在你的设备上（应用沙盒内的存档文件与系统偏好设置）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Your progress is stored only on your device (a save file in the app sandbox and system preferences)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 不含广告、不含第三方统计或追踪 SDK，不请求定位、通讯录、相机等权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• No ads, no third-party analytics or tracking SDKs, and no location, contacts or camera permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 内购由 Apple App Store 处理，我们拿不到你的支付信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• In-app purchases are handled by the Apple App Store; we never see your payment details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 删除应用即可清除全部数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Deleting the app removes all data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
