    "欢迎来到小港口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to the little harbor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你雇的小熊船长们会自己出海打鱼——而且一出海就不太想回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your bear captains sail out to fish on their own — and once they're out, they'd rather not come back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "挂机也能赚": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Earn while idle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "船长们会自动出海、捕鱼、返航卖鱼。离开游戏时他们也在干活，回来记得收钱。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captains sail, fish and sell automatically. They keep working while you're away — collect when you return."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "探索真实海域": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explore real seas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解锁新海域、升级船和渔具，收集 32 种真实鱼类的图鉴。四季轮换，不同季节有不同的鱼。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock new seas, upgrade boats and gear, and collect 32 real fish species. Seasons rotate, and each brings different fish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的私人鱼缸": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your private aquarium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把喜欢的鱼留进鱼缸慢慢欣赏，点一下就能看小百科。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep your favourite fish in the aquarium and tap one to read about it."
